#   paragraph selection, and the default actions of a mouse down
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Page/EventHandler.cpp lines 1005-1382 (handle_mouseup,
#       initiate_character_selection, initiate_word_selection, initiate_paragraph_selection,
#       run_mousedown_default_actions, handle_mousedown).
